; Datom's public conceptual data anatomy. This declaration covers the
; serializable conceptual surface, not every operational or borrowed Rust
; helper. Meaning is represented as its one opaque String position; Rust's
; tuple wrapper is not a distinct Ethos declaration form. Error is omitted:
; its unit Datom layer collides with the defined Datom type under Ethos's
; named-type-variant rule, so a declaration would falsely give that unit data.
; The kinds have their one home in datom-codec-kinds.ethos.
Library
[ protos:[ Extent Protos ReaderBudget Separator Symbol ] ]
[ Path.Vector<Integer>
  Opaque.String
  FormVariant.{ Symbol Datom }
  Datom.{ Path Form }
  Form.[ Struct.Vector<Datom>
         Vector.Vector<Datom>
         Variant.FormVariant
         Bare.String
         String.String
         Meaning.Opaque ]
  Budget.{ Integer ReaderBudget Integer Integer } ]
[]
